#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:387
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This will remove all currently not active global shortcuts for %1 from "
#| "this list. %1 is removed too if no shortcut is left.\n"
#| "All global shortcuts will reregister themselves whenever they are "
#| "activated the next time!"
msgid ""
"Component '%1' is currently active. Only global shortcuts currently not "
"active will be removed from the list.\n"
"All global shortcuts will reregister themselves with their default when they "
"are started the next time!"
msgstr ""
"Isto eliminará desta lista a todos os atallos globais que non estexan "
"activos para %1, e %1 tamén se non lle quedan atallos.\n"
"Os os atallos globais han rexistrarse de novo a vindeira vez que  sexan "
"activados!"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:389 kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:399
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Clean component"
msgid "Remove component"
msgstr "Limpara a compoñente"

#: kglobalshortcutseditor.cpp:395
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This will remove all currently not active global shortcuts for %1 from "
#| "this list. %1 is removed too if no shortcut is left.\n"
#| "All global shortcuts will reregister themselves whenever they are "
#| "activated the next time!"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the registered shortcuts for component '%1'? "
"The component and shortcuts will reregister themselves with their default "
"setting when they are started the next time."
msgstr ""
"Isto eliminará desta lista a todos os atallos globais que non estexan "
"activos para %1, e %1 tamén se non lle quedan atallos.\n"
"Os os atallos globais han rexistrarse de novo a vindeira vez que  sexan "
"activados!"

